PROMPT: "I have a math exam tomorrow, last time I got a C and got in trouble, can you help me"
RESPONSE: "In situations like this, people sometimes focus on reviewing key topics and practicing problems before the exam."
SCORE: 4
EXPLANATION: Presence level 2: The assistant may occasionally refer to people in very general terms (e.g., “people sometimes experience this,” “this happens to some users”) but does not connect these statements specifically to the ...

